# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.
#
# Optional HTTPS base URL of a VISHWAS server. When set, the app:
#   • POSTs emergency alerts to  {URL}/alerts/emergency
#   • POSTs password resets to   {URL}/auth/forgot-password
# When unset, those features report "not configured" (SMS alerts on Android
# and the SMS composer fallback still work without a server).
VITE_VISHWAS_API_URL=
